      "test": "com.kartaguez.pocoma.runtime.command.v3.ConsumptionLifecycleCompositionPostgresTest#renewalsHaveReservedDatabaseAccess",
      "classification": "Case 2 — Test bench defect (L2/I3 test pool configured with minimumIdle=0 vs production V3ConsumptionWorkerConfiguration minimumIdle=maximumPoolSize=8)",
      "root_cause": "In HikariCP 7.0.2, HikariPool$PoolEntryCreator creates at most 1 connection per task and calls quietlySleep(30L) on the single-threaded addConnectionExecutor after connectionBag.add(poolEntry). Under minimumIdle=0, after borrowing the 5 held connections, when 3 concurrent renewal threads call ConcurrentBag.borrow(1000, MILLISECONDS), each increments waiters (1, 2, 3) and calls addBagItem(waiting) which checks waiting > addConnectionExecutor.getQueue().size(). When the thread with waiting=1 reaches addBagItem(1) after the threads with waiting=2 and waiting=3 have queued 2 tasks while addConnectionExecutor is still in quietlySleep(30L), 1 > 2 is false, dropping the 3rd PoolEntryCreator task. With minimumIdle=0, fillPool() is a no-op, leaving total=7, active=7, idle=0, waiting=1 until the 3rd lane times out after 1000ms with SQLTransientConnectionException -> CannotCreateTransactionException -> AttemptTransactions.Failure(Resolution.UNKNOWN) without ever obtaining a PostgreSQL backend PID.",
      "fix": "Set pool.setMinimumIdle(8) and awaitPhysicalPoolReserve(pool, 8) in ConsumptionLifecycleCompositionPostgresTest#renewalsHaveReservedDatabaseAccess, matching V3ConsumptionWorkerConfiguration.createPool while preserving maximumPoolSize=8, 5 held connections, 3 concurrent renewal lanes, 1000ms connectionTimeout, 8s barrier, and all assertions.",
      "counter_oracle": "assertUnreservedRenewalFailsWhenSixHeld holds 6 non-renewal connections out of 8 (leaving only 2 reserved connections for 3 renewal lanes) and verifies that the 3rd renewal lane fails within ~1s with AttemptTransactions.Failure(Resolution.UNKNOWN) caused by SQLTransientConnectionException (total=8, active=8, idle=0, waiting=0).",
